    <!-- Video Re-Sync: circular sync arrows around a video camera.
         Tinted white at the VECTOR level rather than in the layout, so the Field Guide's
         example renders identically to the toolbar. (ic_camera_shutter was the other icon
         drawn this way; it went with the on-screen shutter pill.)
         That guide's whole premise is that its icons ARE the app's icons; a layout-only tint
         would have quietly broken it.
         The path colours below are now overridden by the tint and kept only so the shapes stay
         legible if the tint is ever removed. It was previously two-tone blue/cyan, which read
         as a different class of control once the button gained the pill frame its white-glyph
         neighbours use. -->
